WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.370
This is Forex Mercatus Codex, a gold-first research terminal for paper trading only.

2
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.310
There is no broker connection and no live orders.

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.480
It charts real historical data for nine symbols.

4
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:18.030
A strategy lab runs walk-forward tests and Monte Carlo, and on-device machine learning reports its honest out-of-sample score.

5
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.990
Model outputs are probabilities with measured error, never guarantees.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.550
There are risk tools, a pattern scanner, a South African session clock and a trade journal.

7
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.630
Everything runs in your browser.
